      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Script's Purpose**\n\nOkay, I'm now zeroing in on defining the `batch_translate.py` script and the external translation service it will use. The user wants the script to translate an ordered list of strings, so I must figure out what external translation service to use. The design needs to be concrete, including identifying the specific external provider.\n\n\n**Pinpointing the Implementation**\n\nNow I'm focusing on the implementation details. I've decided to use the Google Cloud Translation API via the `google-cloud-translate` library. The `batch_translate.py` file will have a `batch_translate_text` function. This function will use `google.cloud.translate_v3.TranslationServiceClient`. This plan keeps things simple, taking the list of strings, the target language, and the project ID as inputs. The provider-specific import and client class will ensure clarity about the chosen translation service.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819546610,
          "start": 1789819544995
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b98ee5a3001jMnhn6w34jqYTG",
      "message_id": "msg_0b98ee00f001I62OO4HACRNpZ8",
      "session_id": "ses_f4671200cffemucvcbL3hFQ3O6",
      "time_created": 1789819544995,
      "time_updated": 1789819546610
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "wkbQ2I5oarKrAIs9",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from google.cloud import translate_v3 as translate\n\ndef batch_translate_text(\n    texts: list[str],\n    target_language_code: str,\n    project_id: str\n) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"Translates a list of strings into the target language while preserving order.\"\"\"\n\n    client = translate.TranslationServiceClient()\n    parent = f\"projects/{project_id}/locations/global\"\n\n    response = client.translate_text(\n        parent=parent,\n        contents=texts,\n        target_language_code=target_language_code,\n    )\n\n    translated_texts = [translation.translated_text for translation in response.translations]\n    return translated_texts\n",
            "filePath": "batch_translate.py"
          },
          "metadata": {
