      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Translation Provider**\n\nI've decided to use the Google Cloud Translation API for this task. The code will need to clearly identify it as the chosen provider. This will be the foundation for the file `translate_text.py`.\n\n\n**Implementing Translation Logic**\n\nI'm now building the `translate_text.py` file, focusing on integrating the Google Cloud Translation API. The next step involves embedding the translation logic itself, using the `google.cloud.translate_v3` client to handle the language translation. I'll make sure to clearly identify it as the chosen provider. The import and client initialization will be the core of making it identifiable.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819542644,
          "start": 1789819540902
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
